{"unit_id":"tag:095Q:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为满射（surjective）态射（morphism），在拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）概形（schemes）之间。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 设<MATH_0002>为集合（sets）层（sheaf），定义于<MATH_0003>上。则<MATH_0004>可构造（constructible），当且仅当<MATH_0005>可构造（constructible）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 设<MATH_0006>为阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf），定义于<MATH_0007>上。则<MATH_0008>可构造（constructible），当且仅当<MATH_0009>可构造（constructible）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 设<MATH_0010>为Noether环（Noetherian ring）。设<MATH_0011>为层（sheaf），其成员是<MATH_0012>-模（modules），定义于<MATH_0013>上。则<MATH_0014>可构造（constructible），当且仅当<MATH_0015>可构造（constructible）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"Noether环"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"constructible","t