{"unit_id":"tag:095Q:proof","translation":"一个方向由引理<REF_0001>推出。反过来，假设<MATH_0001>可构造（constructible）。将<MATH_0002>写成可构造层（constructible sheaves）（集合（sets）、阿贝尔群（abelian groups）或模（modules）的层）的滤过余极限（filtered colimit），利用引理<REF_0002>。由于<MATH_0003>为左伴随（left adjoint），它与余极限（colimits）交换（commutes）（《范畴（Categories）》引理<REF_0003>），于是可见<MATH_0004>。由引理<REF_0004>可见<MATH_0005>为满射（surjective），对所有充分大（large）的<MATH_0006>成立。由于<MATH_0007>为满射（surjective），我们得出（通过考察茎（stalks），利用引理<REF_0005>和定理<REF_0006>）<MATH_0008>为满射（surjective），对所有充分大（large）的<MATH_0009>成立。因此<MATH_0010>是可构造（constructible）层（sheaf）<MATH_0011>的商（quotient）。再次对<MATH_0012>或映射<MATH_0013>的核（kernel）应用这一论证，我们得到结论，利用了<MATH_0014>正合（exact），以及可构造层（constructible sheaves）（集合（sets）、阿贝尔群（abelian groups）或模（modules）的层）的范畴（category）在有限（finite）（余）极限（limits）或（余）核（kernels）下保持不变，这些运算在<MATH_0015>、<MATH_0016>、<MATH_0017>、<MATH_0018>、<MATH_0019>及<MATH_0020>内部进行，参见引理<REF_0007>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"constructible sheaves","target_term":"可构造层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"filtered colimit","target_term":"滤过余极限"},{"source_term":"left adjoint","target_term":"左伴随"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"large","target_term":"充分大"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"large","target_term":"充分大"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"constructible sheaves","target_term":"可构造层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"limits","target_term":"极限"},{"source_term":"kernels","target_term":"核"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造","context":"可构造层。"},{"source_term":"constructible sheaves","target_term":"可构造层","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"filtered colimit","target_term":"滤过余极限","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"left adjoint","target_term":"左伴随","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"函子与余极限交换。"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"引用章节。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"large","target_term":"充分大","context":"滤过指标充分大。"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎","context":"层的茎。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"函子正合性。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"limits","target_term":"极限","context":"有限极限与余极限。"},{"source_term":"kernels","target_term":"核","context":"核与余核。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:095H:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为有限（finite）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism），在概形（schemes）之间。设<MATH_0002>为Noether环（Noetherian ring）。若<MATH_0003>是可构造（constructible）集合（sets）层（sheaf）、可构造（constructible）阿贝尔群（abelian groups）层（sheaf），或可构造（constructible）层（sheaf），其成员是<MATH_0004>-模（modules），定义于<MATH_0005>上，则<MATH_0006>在<MATH_0007>上也具有相同性质。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"Noether环"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"Noether环","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造","context":"可构造层。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:095H:proof","translation":"由引理<REF_0001>，只需在<MATH_0001>上Zariski局部地检查这一点，并且由引理<REF_0002>，可以将<MATH_0002>替换为平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）覆盖（cover）（<MATH_0003>的构造与平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）局部化（localization）交换（commutes））。有限（finite）平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）态射（morphism）在平展（<ACCENT_0004>tale）局部同构（isomorphic）于同构（isomorphisms）的不交并（disjoint union），参见《平展（<ACCENT_0005>tale）态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0003>。因此，对集合（sets）层（sheaves），该引理说若<MATH_0004>、<MATH_0005>是集合（sets）的可构造层（constructible sheaves），则<MATH_0006>也是如此。这是显然的。对阿贝尔群（abelian groups）层（sheaves）与模（modules）同样成立。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"cover","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"disjoint union","target_term":"不交并"},{"source_term":"Étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"constructible sheaves","target_term":"可构造层"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"cover","target_term":"覆盖","context":"平展覆盖。"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"构造与局部化交换。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"disjoint union","target_term":"不交并","context":"概形的不交并。"},{"source_term":"Étale","target_term":"平展","context":"引用章节。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章节。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"constructible sheaves","target_term":"可构造层","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
